<title>SPAIN: Spain had 803.4 bln peseta Aug budget deficit.</title>
<headline>Spain had 803.4 bln peseta Aug budget deficit.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Economy Ministry gave the</p>
<p>following figures in billions of pesetas:</p>
<p> BUDGET OPERATIONS	  AUG 96	  JULY 96	AUG 95</p>
<p> Revenues			780.7	  1,851.5	 826.3</p>
<p> Expenditure		 1,584.1	  1,569.4     1,553.1</p>
<p> Deficit/surplus	    -803.4	    282.1	-726.8</p>
<p> Def/surplus to date    -1,987.0	 -1,184.0    -2,183.5</p>
<p> GBR yr to date	    1,492.0	  1,866.7     2,817.7</p>
<p>NOTE - The figures relate to central government finances only. GBR = government borrowing requirement.</p>
</text>
